  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response Fund is managed by the UN&apos;s Office for the         Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs (OCHA).                           It is a tool at the disposal of the Humanitarian Coordinator that    enables rapid and flexible funding to urgent humanitarian needs and   facilitates coordination of emergency response activities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Emergency Response Fund &#xe4;r en fond som sk&#xf6;ts av FN:s Office for the   Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs (OCHA).                           Det &#xe4;r en fond d&#xe4;r den humanit&#xe4;ra koordinatorn har m&#xf6;jlighet att     snabbt och flexibelt allokera medel till nya eller f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;rrade kriser  samt underl&#xe4;tta koordinering av insatser vid n&#xf6;dsituationer.</narrative>
  </description>
